<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$25 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$25 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MLC Building Society was the only promissory note issuer to hold a tender in the Australian market on Monday.</p>
<p>MLC sold a A$15 million parcel of its p-notes at a touch over three basis points over the corresponding bank bill rate.</p>
<p>A A$10 million parcel of its paper also sold at about five points over bill.</p>
<p>The physical bank bill yield curve has weakened slightly from its pre-weekend levels on thin dealings, dealers said.</p>
